{"slug":"b-e-th","ar":"ب ع ث","total":67,"core":"sending; raising","forms":[{"ar":"بَعَثَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":52,"gloss":"to send; to resurrect","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":87,"p":4,"ar":["وَلَا","تُخْزِنِى","يَوْمَ","يُبْعَثُونَ"],"en":"And do not disgrace me on the Day they are [all] resurrected"}},{"ar":"مَّبْعُوثُون","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"resurrected","word":null,"ex":{"s":83,"a":4,"p":5,"ar":["أَلَا","يَظُنُّ","أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","أَنَّهُم","مَّبْعُوثُونَ"],"en":"Do they not think that they will be resurrected"}},{"ar":"بَعْث","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"Resurrection","word":"al-bath","ex":{"s":31,"a":28,"p":4,"ar":["مَّا","خَلْقُكُمْ","وَلَا","بَعْثُكُمْ","إِلَّا","كَنَفْسٍ","وَٰحِدَةٍ ۗ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَمِيعٌۢ","بَصِيرٌ"],"en":"Your creation and your resurrection will not be but as that of a single soul. Indeed, Allah is Hearing and Seeing"}},{"ar":"ٱنۢبَعَثَ","kind":"verb","form":7,"count":1,"gloss":"to rise up, be sent forth","word":null,"ex":{"s":91,"a":12,"p":2,"ar":["إِذِ","ٱنۢبَعَثَ","أَشْقَىٰهَا"],"en":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth"}},{"ar":"ٱنبِعَاث","kind":"verbal noun","form":7,"count":1,"gloss":"setting out, going forth","word":null,"ex":{"s":9,"a":46,"p":10,"ar":["وَلَوْ","أَرَادُوا۟","ٱلْخُرُوجَ","لَأَعَدُّوا۟","لَهُۥ","عُدَّةً","وَلَـٰكِن","كَرِهَ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱنۢبِعَاثَهُمْ","فَثَبَّطَهُمْ","وَقِيلَ","ٱقْعُدُوا۟","مَعَ","ٱلْقَـٰعِدِينَ"],"en":"And if they had intended to go forth, they would have prepared for it [some] preparation. But Allah disliked their being sent, so He kept them back, and they were told, \"Remain [behind] with those who remain"}}],"surahs":[[2,6],[17,6],[16,5],[6,4],[23,4],[7,3],[18,3],[5,2],[10,2],[19,2],[22,2],[25,2],[26,2],[30,2],[37,2],[58,2],[64,2],[3,1],[4,1],[9,1],[11,1],[15,1],[27,1],[28,1],[31,1],[36,1],[38,1],[40,1],[56,1],[62,1],[72,1],[83,1],[91,1]]}